{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":10,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 10:1"},"The proverbs of Solomon. A wise son maketh a glad father: but a foolish son ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the heaviness of his mother. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 10:2"},"Treasures of wickedness profit nothing: but righteousness delivereth from death. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 10:3"},"The LORD will not suffer the soul of the righteous to famish: but he casteth away the substance of the wicked. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 10:4"},"He becometh poor that dealeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with"]}," a slack hand: but the hand of the diligent maketh rich. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 10:5"},"He that gathereth in summer ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a wise son: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," he that sleepeth in harvest ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a son that causeth shame. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 10:6"},"Blessings ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," upon the head of the just: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 10:7"},"The memory of the just is blessed: but the name of the wicked shall rot. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 10:8"},"The wise in heart will receive commandments: but a prating fool shall fall. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 10:9"},"He that walketh uprightly walketh surely: but he that perverteth his ways shall be known. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 10:10"},"He that winketh with the eye causeth sorrow: but a prating fool shall fall. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 10:11"},"The mouth of a righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man is"]}," a well of life: but violence covereth the mouth of the wicked. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 10:12"},"Hatred stirreth up strifes: but love covereth all sins. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 10:13"},"In the lips of him that hath understanding wisdom is found: but a rod ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," for the back of him that is void of understanding. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 10:14"},"Wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," lay up knowledge: but the mouth of the foolish ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," near destruction. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 10:15"},"The rich man’s wealth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," his strong city: the destruction of the poor ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," their poverty. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 10:16"},"The labour of the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["tendeth"]}," to life: the fruit of the wicked to sin. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 10:17"},"He ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is in"]}," the way of life that keepeth instruction: but he that refuseth reproof erreth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 10:18"},"He that hideth hatred ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["with"]}," lying lips, and he that uttereth a slander, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," a fool. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 10:19"},"In the multitude of words there wanteth not sin: but he that refraineth his lips ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," wise. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 10:20"},"The tongue of the just ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is as"]}," choice silver: the heart of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," little worth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 10:21"},"The lips of the righteous feed many: but fools die for want of wisdom. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 10:22"},"The blessing of the LORD, it maketh rich, and he addeth no sorrow with it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 10:23"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["It is"]}," as sport to a fool to do mischief: but a man of understanding hath wisdom. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 10:24"},"The fear of the wicked, it shall come upon him: but the desire of the righteous shall be granted. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 10:25"},"As the whirlwind passeth, so ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," the wicked no ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["more: "]},"but the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," an everlasting foundation. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 10:26"},"As vinegar to the teeth, and as smoke to the eyes, so ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is "]},"the sluggard to them that send him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 10:27"},"The fear of the LORD prolongeth days: but the years of the wicked shall be shortened. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:27"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"28","sid":"PRO 10:28"},"The hope of the righteous ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," gladness: but the expectation of the wicked shall perish. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:28"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"29","sid":"PRO 10:29"},"The way of the LORD ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," strength to the upright: but destruction ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["shall be"]}," to the workers of iniquity. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:29"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"30","sid":"PRO 10:30"},"The righteous shall never be removed: but the wicked shall not inhabit the earth. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:30"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"31","sid":"PRO 10:31"},"The mouth of the just bringeth forth wisdom: but the froward tongue shall be cut out. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:31"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"32","sid":"PRO 10:32"},"The lips of the righteous know what is acceptable: but the mouth of the wicked ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["speaketh"]}," frowardness. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 10:32"}]}]}
